{"ID":"20260725195217-gmsftxt","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-gmsftxt","title":"Crash分析框架设计说明","type":"doc","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260725195217-lswesfh","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":1,"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-lswesfh","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"# "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Crash 分析部分框架设计说明"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-oewgnqs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-oewgnqs","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本文说明 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"wxlog_analyze"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 项目中 Crash 分析部分的框架设计。重点覆盖当前 UI 实际使用的“本地规则引擎深度分析”链路，同时说明仍保留但当前休眠的 CLI/LLM 深度分析链路。"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-d9v0syg","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-d9v0syg","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1. 总体定位"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-eysq8d4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-eysq8d4","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Crash 分析功能是主应用里的一个独立业务窗口，入口在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"lib/crash_analysis_window.dart"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。它与旧版普通日志分析功能相对独立，不复用 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"LogManager"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" / "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"TabListDataSource"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 的状态。"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-b1o5t6s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-b1o5t6s","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"整体目标是："}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-w1ykmwh","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":1,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-w1ykmwh","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260725195217-57bksxe","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"1.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":1,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"MS4=","Num":1},"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-57bksxe","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260725195217-5rxte4g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-5rxte4g","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"让客服或开发同学选择 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".zip"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 反馈包、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":".dmp"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" dump 文件，或二者混合输入。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-otfrt5p","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"2.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":2,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"Mi4=","Num":2},"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-otfrt5p","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260725195217-pu2et3o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-pu2et3o","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"自动解压反馈包，扫描可用 dump。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-n3tcxf3","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"3.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":3,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"My4=","Num":3},"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-n3tcxf3","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260725195217-p4m7sys","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-p4m7sys","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"把 dump 上传到 CDB MCP 服务，创建调试 session。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-lbug6hi","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"4.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":4,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"NC4=","Num":4},"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-lbug6hi","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260725195217-hj9dmqv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-hj9dmqv","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先通过 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"quick_triage"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 做轻量预筛，过滤非 crash dump，最多保留 5 个候选。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-lxv8qom","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"5.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":5,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"NS4=","Num":5},"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-lxv8qom","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260725195217-kptvfg4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-kptvfg4","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对候选 dump 做本地确定性深度采证。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-b4mqwct","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"6.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":6,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"Ni4=","Num":6},"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-b4mqwct","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260725195217-74bbzoq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-74bbzoq","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用本地规则引擎归因，输出分类、证据、话术。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-scuevf2","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"7.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":7,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"Ny4=","Num":7},"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-scuevf2","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260725195217-hvswevd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-hvswevd","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对内存类 crash 额外扫描企微日志，补充系统 OOM / 进程虚拟地址耗尽等结论。"}]}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-m5f302e","Type":"NodeListItem","Data":"8.","ListData":{"Typ":1,"Tight":true,"Start":8,"Delimiter":46,"Padding":3,"Marker":"OC4=","Num":8},"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-m5f302e","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260725195217-5m3z6ai","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-5m3z6ai","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"将结果写入本地 JSONL，并上报统计服务。"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-b71emra","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-b71emra","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"可以把它理解成一个“多阶段流水线”："}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-2byutmr","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-2byutmr","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"UI 文件选择\n  -\u003e 输入归一化(zip/dmp/mixed)\n  -\u003e dump 扫描与解压\n  -\u003e MCP 上传 + quick_triage 预筛\n  -\u003e crash 签名分组\n  -\u003e 本地深度采证\n  -\u003e 本地规则归因\n  -\u003e 内存日志专项补强\n  -\u003e 多组汇总与话术生成\n  -\u003e UI 展示 + 归档上报\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-iiaybps","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-iiaybps","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"更直观地看，Crash 分析部分可以分成这些层："}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-cgtr719","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-cgtr719","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"flowchart TB\n  subgraph UI[\"UI 层\"]\n    Window[\"crash_analysis_window.dart\u003cbr/\u003e文件选择、按钮状态、结果展示\"]\n  end\n\n  subgraph Orchestrator[\"编排 / 状态层\"]\n    Manager[\"crash_analysis_manager.dart\u003cbr/\u003e状态机、流程调度、超时、归档触发\"]\n  end\n\n  subgraph Input[\"输入处理层\"]\n    PipelineInput[\"crash_pipeline_input.dart\u003cbr/\u003ezip 解压、dmp 扫描、SHA-1 去重、预筛\"]\n  end\n\n  subgraph Infra[\"外部服务桥接层\"]\n    McpBridge[\"crash_mcp_bridge.dart\u003cbr/\u003e上传 dump、创建 session、执行 CDB 命令\"]\n    CdbServer[\"CDB MCP 服务\u003cbr/\u003e实际调试 dump\"]\n  end\n\n  subgraph Analysis[\"分析引擎层\"]\n    DeepAnalyzer[\"crash_local_deep_analyzer.dart\u003cbr/\u003e深度采证\"]\n    RuleEngine[\"crash_local_rule_engine.dart\u003cbr/\u003e规则归因、分组、话术基础\"]\n    MemoryAnalyzer[\"memory_crash_log_analyzer.dart\u003cbr/\u003e内存日志专项分析\"]\n  end\n\n  subgraph Archive[\"归档 / 统计层\"]\n    ArchiveRecord[\"analysis_archive_record.dart\u003cbr/\u003e归档数据结构\"]\n    ArchiveService[\"analysis_archive_service.dart\u003cbr/\u003e本地 JSONL + HTTP 上报\"]\n    StatsServer[\"wxlog_stats_server\u003cbr/\u003e统计 API + Web 看板\"]\n  end\n\n  Window --\u003e Manager\n  Manager --\u003e PipelineInput\n  PipelineInput --\u003e McpBridge\n  McpBridge --\u003e CdbServer\n  Manager --\u003e DeepAnalyzer\n  DeepAnalyzer --\u003e McpBridge\n  Manager --\u003e RuleEngine\n  Manager --\u003e MemoryAnalyzer\n  MemoryAnalyzer --\u003e RuleEngine\n  Manager --\u003e ArchiveRecord\n  Manager --\u003e ArchiveService\n  ArchiveService --\u003e StatsServer\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-mnaw85i","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-mnaw85i","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2. 主要文件职责"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-6j0u5dd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-6j0u5dd","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这一节只列架构理解最需要的职责和入口。更细的分支逻辑放到后面的“当前主链路详解”里讲。"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-yjl2x0u","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-yjl2x0u","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"lib/crash_analysis_window.dart"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-3rddn24","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-3rddn24","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Crash 分析窗口的 UI 层。它负责文件选择、按钮状态、状态监听、结果展示、备注和反馈，不直接处理 dump、CDB 或规则归因。"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-zur0pq2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-zur0pq2","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主调用链："}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-h19g1rz","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-h19g1rz","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 选择 zip / dmp 文件\n_onSelectPackagePressed()\n\n// 点击“本地深度分析”后的总入口\n_onLocalDeepAnalyzePressed()\n  // 根据输入类型分发到 dmp / zip / mixed 分支\n  -\u003e _startLocalDmpAnalyze()\n   / _startLocalZipAnalyze()\n   / _startLocalMixedAnalyze()\n  // 把整理好的文件路径交给 manager\n  -\u003e CrashAnalysisManager.startLocalAnalyze(...)\n   / CrashAnalysisManager.startLocalAnalyzeWithZip(...)\n\n// 提交用户对分析结果的反馈\n_onFeedback(...)\n  // 写入本地归档并异步上报统计服务\n  -\u003e AnalysisArchiveService.instance.updateFeedback(...)\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-o1zm4jb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-o1zm4jb","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"lib/crash_analysis_manager.dart"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-y8df7gx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-y8df7gx","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Crash 分析的状态机和总编排层。它继承 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"ChangeNotifier"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，负责状态切换、配置加载、输入归一化、预筛、深度分析、结果汇总、归档和 session 清理。"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-j0dh03t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-j0dh03t","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主调用链："}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-maihpba","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-maihpba","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 本地分析入口：接收 dmp、zip 或混合输入\nstartLocalAnalyze(...) / startLocalAnalyzeWithZip(...)\n  // 加载 MCP、归档、统计等配置\n  -\u003e _ensureAppConfigOrFail()\n  // 把 zip / dmp 输入统一成 dump 路径列表\n  -\u003e scanMixedInput(...) / scanMultipleZipFiles(...)\n  // 预筛完成后决定进入本地规则链路或保留的 CLI 链路\n  -\u003e _runPrefilterAndFinalize(...)\n  // 上传 dump 并执行 quick_triage，筛出 crash 候选\n  -\u003e prefilterCrashDumps(...)\n  // 对候选 dump 做本地深度采证和规则归因\n  -\u003e _runLocalDeepAnalysis(...)\n  // 根据结果切换 UI 状态\n  -\u003e _enterDone(...) / _enterFailed(...)\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-969865n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-969865n","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"startAnalyze(...)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" / "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"startAnalyzeWithZip(...)"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 是保留的 CLI/LLM 链路入口，当前 UI 按钮没有绑定。"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-j4x0eez","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-j4x0eez","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"lib/analysis/crash_pipeline_input.dart"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-rj283ic","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-rj283ic","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"输入归一化和预筛层。它把 zip、dmp、混合输入统一成 dump 路径列表，并通过 MCP "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"quick_triage"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 筛出最多 5 个 crash 候选，默认并发度是 2。"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-ssdhvk6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-ssdhvk6","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主调用链："}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-rotrxvc","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-rotrxvc","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 批量处理 zip：逐个解压并扫描 dump / pdb / dll\nscanMultipleZipFiles(...)\n  // 处理单个 zip\n  -\u003e _scanFromZip(...)\n  // 在后台 isolate 中解压，避免阻塞 UI\n  -\u003e _unzipToIsolate(...)\n  // 收集解压目录下的 dump 和符号相关文件\n  -\u003e _collectDumpAndSymbol(...)\n\n// 处理 zip + dmp 混合输入\nscanMixedInput(...)\n  // 先处理 zip 部分\n  -\u003e scanMultipleZipFiles(...)\n  // 再处理用户直接选择的 dmp 部分\n  -\u003e _scanFromDmpList(...)\n\n// 批量预筛 dump，最多保留 5 个 crash 候选\nprefilterCrashDumps(...)\n  // 按并发窗口启动预筛任务\n  -\u003e _fillConcurrencyWindow(...)\n  // 单个 dump 的上传、建 session、quick_triage 流程\n  -\u003e _processSingleDump(...)\n  // MCP 预筛的核心 HTTP 调用序列\n  -\u003e createUploadToken(...) -\u003e uploadDump(...) -\u003e createSession(...) -\u003e execQuickTriage(...)\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-t72rf19","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-t72rf19","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"lib/analysis/crash_mcp_bridge.dart"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-gv8nwuu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-gv8nwuu","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"MCP/CDB 服务桥接层。它只负责 HTTP 调用，不解析业务语义，也不缓存 session。"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-lh6iimx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-lh6iimx","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主调用链："}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-6b7w3f0","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-6b7w3f0","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"预筛:\n// 申请上传 token、上传 dump、创建 CDB session，并执行 quick_triage\ncreateUploadToken(...) -\u003e uploadDump(...) -\u003e createSession(...) -\u003e execQuickTriage(...)\n\n深度采证:\n// 在已有 session 上执行 preset 或 CDB 命令\nexecDeepPreset(...) / execDeepCommands(...)\n\n清理:\n// 关闭 CDB session，释放服务端资源\ncloseSession(...)\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-rn12yet","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-rn12yet","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"lib/analysis/crash_local_deep_analyzer.dart"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-cmkyovm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-cmkyovm","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本地深度采证层。它从 MCP/CDB 获取结构化证据，不做最终归因。"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-yoyrkxi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-yoyrkxi","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主调用链："}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-w6jn6g4","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-w6jn6g4","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 深度采证主入口：从 CDB 拉取结构化证据\nrunDeepCollection(...)\n  // 获取异常信息\n  -\u003e execDeepPreset(exception_info)\n  // 获取模块列表\n  -\u003e execDeepPreset(module_list)\n  // 切到异常上下文并获取调用栈\n  -\u003e execDeepCommands(.ecxr; kb)\n  // 获取 WinDbg 自动分析结果\n  -\u003e execDeepCommands(!analyze -v)\n  // 汇总成规则引擎可消费的数据对象\n  -\u003e DeepCollectionResult\n\n// 第三方模块命中但路径缺失时补查模块详情\nenrichMissingModulePaths(...)\n  // 用 lmvm 查询 DLL 路径等模块信息\n  -\u003e execDeepCommands(lmvm ...)\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-2qbn5fj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-2qbn5fj","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"lib/analysis/crash_local_rule_engine.dart"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-zbzw5zw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-zbzw5zw","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本地确定性规则引擎。它负责多 dump 分组和单组归因，规则采用“先命中先返回”，规则顺序就是优先级。"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-1yt6sqz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-1yt6sqz","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主调用链："}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-itxesny","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-itxesny","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 多 dump 分组入口：把相同 crash 签名合并\ngroupBySignature(...)\n  // 从 quick_triage 中提取异常码、模块、函数等签名\n  -\u003e 提取 quick_triage 签名\n  // 精确分组：异常码 + 模块 + 函数\n  -\u003e L1 分组\n  // 宽松合并：异常码 + 模块\n  -\u003e L2 合并\n  // 输出供 manager 串行分析的分组列表\n  -\u003e CrashGroup 列表\n\n// 单组归因入口：根据采证结果匹配规则\nanalyze(...)\n  // 按优先级依次尝试内存、第三方、微信自身、未知等规则\n  -\u003e 内存 / 第三方 / 微信自身 / 未知等规则按优先级匹配\n  // 输出分类、置信度、证据和话术\n  -\u003e LocalAnalysisResult\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-zvdfqne","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-zvdfqne","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"lib/analysis/memory_crash_log_analyzer.dart"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-dmjmx14","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-dmjmx14","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"内存 crash 专项分析器。它反查反馈包中的企微日志，补充判断系统 OOM、企微自身虚拟地址耗尽，或数据不足。"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-jx38yd5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-jx38yd5","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主调用链："}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-oxb64yz","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-oxb64yz","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 内存日志专项分析入口\nanalyzeMemoryLogs(...)\n  // 找到反馈包里的企微日志\n  -\u003e 定位反馈包日志\n  // 读取普通日志，必要时解密加密日志\n  -\u003e 读取 / 解密日志\n  // 提取内存相关指标\n  -\u003e 提取 Memory、sys、MemoryInspector、Environment 指标\n  // 输出内存 crash 结论；无法判断时可返回 null\n  -\u003e MemoryCrashAnalysisResult?\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-iuhc6i4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-iuhc6i4","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"lib/archive/analysis_archive_service.dart"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-8pyvpre","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-8pyvpre","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归档服务。它负责写本地 JSONL，并异步上报统计服务；失败静默降级，不阻断主分析流程。"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-v1nftn2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-v1nftn2","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主调用链："}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-xzxle8j","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-xzxle8j","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 写入一条分析归档\nwriteRecord(...)\n  // 写入本地 JSONL 文件\n  -\u003e 写本地 JSONL\n  // 异步上报统计服务，失败不影响主流程\n  -\u003e _postToServer(...) [异步上报]\n\n// 更新用户反馈或备注\nupdateFeedback(...) / updateRemark(...)\n  // 更新本地已有记录\n  -\u003e 更新本地记录\n  // 异步同步到统计服务\n  -\u003e _postFeedbackToServer(...) / _postRemarkToServer(...) [异步上报]\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-1rf8ffr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-1rf8ffr","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"lib/app_config.dart"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-1ljnwrw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-1ljnwrw","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"应用配置加载器。它首次读取 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"config/app_config.json"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，之后缓存 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"AppConfig"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，供 MCP、CLI、统计服务和归档路径使用。"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-e9a4tu5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-e9a4tu5","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主调用链："}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-y7vk1q2","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-y7vk1q2","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"// 加载应用配置的单例入口\nAppConfigLoader.instance.load()\n  // 读取项目配置文件\n  -\u003e 读取 config/app_config.json\n  // 解析各类运行时配置\n  -\u003e 解析 MCP、CLI、统计服务、归档目录配置\n  // 缓存配置，避免重复读取文件\n  -\u003e 缓存 AppConfig\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-6mjyidb","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-6mjyidb","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3. 当前主链路详解"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-6kyn5ng","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-6kyn5ng","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"先看一张完整主流程图。图里的“当前主线”指 UI 现在实际走的本地规则引擎链路，不是休眠的 CLI/LLM 链路。"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-xpe1302","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-xpe1302","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"sequenceDiagram\n  autonumber\n  actor User as 用户\n  participant UI as CrashAnalysisWindow\n  participant M as CrashAnalysisManager\n  participant Input as crash_pipeline_input\n  participant MCP as CrashMcpBridge\n  participant CDB as CDB MCP 服务\n  participant Deep as CrashLocalDeepAnalyzer\n  participant Rule as CrashLocalRuleEngine\n  participant Mem as MemoryCrashLogAnalyzer\n  participant Arc as AnalysisArchiveService\n\n  User-\u003e\u003eUI: 选择 zip / dmp / 混合文件\n  User-\u003e\u003eUI: 点击“本地深度分析”\n  UI-\u003e\u003eM: startLocalAnalyze / startLocalAnalyzeWithZip\n  M-\u003e\u003eM: 加载 AppConfig，进入 analyzing\n\n  alt 输入包含 zip\n    M-\u003e\u003eInput: scanMultipleZipFiles / scanMixedInput\n    Input-\u003e\u003eInput: 解压 zip，扫描 dump / pdb / dll\n  else 只选择 dmp\n    M-\u003e\u003eInput: 直接整理 dmp 列表\n  end\n\n  M-\u003e\u003eInput: prefilterCrashDumps\n  loop 默认并发 2，最多保留 5 个候选\n    Input-\u003e\u003eMCP: createUploadToken\n    MCP-\u003e\u003eCDB: 申请上传 token\n    Input-\u003e\u003eMCP: uploadDump\n    MCP-\u003e\u003eCDB: 上传 dump\n    Input-\u003e\u003eMCP: createSession\n    MCP-\u003e\u003eCDB: 创建 CDB session\n    Input-\u003e\u003eMCP: execQuickTriage\n    MCP-\u003e\u003eCDB: quick_triage\n    Input-\u003e\u003eInput: 判断 crash / suspected / nonCrash\n  end\n\n  M-\u003e\u003eRule: groupBySignature\n  loop 每个 crash 分组串行处理\n    M-\u003e\u003eDeep: runDeepCollection\n    Deep-\u003e\u003eMCP: exception_info / module_list / kb / !analyze -v\n    MCP-\u003e\u003eCDB: 执行 CDB 命令\n    Deep--\u003e\u003eM: DeepCollectionResult\n    M-\u003e\u003eRule: analyze(collection)\n    Rule--\u003e\u003eM: LocalAnalysisResult\n\n    opt 第三方命中但 DLL 路径缺失\n      M-\u003e\u003eDeep: enrichMissingModulePaths(lmvm)\n      Deep-\u003e\u003eMCP: lmvm module\n      Deep--\u003e\u003eM: 补全路径后的 collection\n      M-\u003e\u003eRule: 重新 analyze\n    end\n\n    opt 明确内存信号 bad_alloc / 0xc0000017\n      M-\u003e\u003eMem: analyzeMemoryLogs\n      Mem--\u003e\u003eM: MemoryCrashAnalysisResult\n    end\n  end\n\n  opt 需要兜底内存扫描\n    M-\u003e\u003eMem: analyzeMemoryLogs\n    Mem--\u003e\u003eM: MemoryCrashAnalysisResult / null\n  end\n\n  M-\u003e\u003eM: 构造 MultiDumpAnalysisResult\n  M-\u003e\u003eArc: writeRecord\n  Arc--\u003e\u003eM: 本地 JSONL + 异步 HTTP 上报\n  M--\u003e\u003eUI: notifyListeners\n  UI--\u003e\u003eUser: 展示话术、结论、反馈入口\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-oyd7ymz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-oyd7ymz","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.1 UI 触发"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-afvl2dw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-afvl2dw","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用户在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"CrashAnalysisWindow"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 中选择文件后，点击“本地深度分析”。当前绑定的是本地深度分析入口："}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-bsxx8pv","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-bsxx8pv","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"dGV4dA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"_onLocalDeepAnalyzePressed()\n  -\u003e _startLocalZipAnalyze()\n  -\u003e _manager.startLocalAnalyzeWit