ing --\u003e failed: 配置失败 / 扫描失败 / 深度归因异常 / 超时\n\n  done --\u003e idle: 重新分析 / 清空选择\n  failed --\u003e idle: 重新分析 / 清空选择\n\n  analyzing --\u003e analyzing: 解压、预筛、深度采证、规则归因\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-rm9t6b1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-rm9t6b1","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这张图能帮助理解为什么 UI 层不需要知道每个内部阶段。它只监听 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"status"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"progressText"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"result"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"localMultiResult"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"、"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"errorMsg"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 这些只读状态，然后决定展示分析中、成功或失败。"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-s2lhjg6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-s2lhjg6","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.12 数据流转视角"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-layfhfp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-layfhfp","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"从数据对象看，Crash 分析链路大致是这样流动的："}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-nzu68u0","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-nzu68u0","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"flowchart LR\n  Raw[\"用户选择\u003cbr/\u003ezip / dmp / mixed\"]\n  Scan[\"CrashInputScanResult\u003cbr/\u003e统一得到 dumpFilePathList\"]\n  Prefilter[\"CrashDumpPrefilterResult\u003cbr/\u003e候选 dump + sessionId + quick_triage\"]\n  Groups[\"List\u003cCrashGroup\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e按签名分组\"]\n  Evidence[\"DeepCollectionResult\u003cbr/\u003eCDB 深度证据\"]\n  Attribution[\"LocalAnalysisResult\u003cbr/\u003e分类、第三方、场景、证据\"]\n  Memory[\"MemoryCrashAnalysisResult?\u003cbr/\u003e内存日志专项补强\"]\n  Multi[\"MultiDumpAnalysisResult\u003cbr/\u003e多组汇总、话术、统计\"]\n  Archive[\"AnalysisArchiveRecord\u003cbr/\u003e本地 JSONL + 统计上报\"]\n\n  Raw --\u003e Scan\n  Scan --\u003e Prefilter\n  Prefilter --\u003e Groups\n  Groups --\u003e Evidence\n  Evidence --\u003e Attribution\n  Attribution --\u003e Multi\n  Memory -. 可选补强 .-\u003e Multi\n  Multi --\u003e Archive\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-w1sh2qr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-w1sh2qr","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里最关键的是 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"PrefilteredCrashDump"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 会保留 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"code","TextMarkTextContent":"sessionId"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。预筛阶段创建的 MCP session 不会立刻关闭，而是复用到深度采证阶段；深度分析结束后再统一关闭。"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-umvm75h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-umvm75h","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"## "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4. 线程模型与异步模型"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-97j30df","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-97j30df","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"线程和并发模型可以先看这张图："}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-vn0ad6k","Type":"NodeCodeBlock","IsFencedCodeBlock":true,"CodeBlockFenceChar":96,"CodeBlockFenceLen":3,"CodeBlockOpenFence":"YGBg","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA==","CodeBlockCloseFence":"YGBg","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-vn0ad6k","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceOpenMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceInfoMarker","CodeBlockInfo":"bWVybWFpZA=="},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockCode","Data":"flowchart LR\n  subgraph Main[\"Flutter 主 isolate / UI event loop\"]\n    UI[\"UI 交互\"]\n    Manager[\"CrashAnalysisManager\u003cbr/\u003e状态机 + 流程调度\"]\n    Prefilter[\"prefilterCrashDumps\u003cbr/\u003eFuture 滑动窗口并发\"]\n    Deep[\"本地深度分析\u003cbr/\u003e按 crash 分组串行\"]\n    Timer[\"Stopwatch + Timer.periodic\u003cbr/\u003e读秒和协作式超时\"]\n  end\n\n  subgraph Worker[\"后台 isolate\"]\n    Unzip[\"zip 解压\u003cbr/\u003e避免卡 UI\"]\n  end\n\n  subgraph External[\"外部异步资源\"]\n    Http[\"Dio HTTP 请求\"]\n    CDB[\"CDB MCP 服务\"]\n    FileIO[\"文件 IO / 日志读取\"]\n    Process[\"tools/python.exe\u003cbr/\u003e解密加密日志\"]\n  end\n\n  UI --\u003e Manager\n  Manager --\u003e Unzip\n  Manager --\u003e Prefilter\n  Prefilter --\u003e Http --\u003e CDB\n  Manager --\u003e Deep\n  Deep --\u003e Http\n  Manager --\u003e Timer\n  Manager --\u003e FileIO\n  Manager --\u003e Process\n"},{"Type":"NodeCodeBlockFenceCloseMarker","Data":"```","CodeBlockFenceLen":3}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-d8ixfyk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":3,"Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-d8ixfyk","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeHeadingC8hMarker","Data":"### "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.1 Flutter 主 isolate"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-8cbwfxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-8cbwfxa","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Crash 分析主链路基本运行在 Flutter 主 isolate 的异步事件循环中。"}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-4yic5qu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260725195217-4yic5qu","updated":"20260725195217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里要区分“异步”和“多线程”："}]},{"ID":"20260725195217-cinbc30","Type":"NodeList","ListData":{"Tight":true,"BulletChar":45,"Padding":2,"Marker":"LQ==","Num":-1},"Properties":{"id":"2026072519